<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#000000;">The following is the full official Xray-core documentation, containing the complete text of multiple chapters. Read the relevant chapters to verify configuration fields, values, and usage restrictions:</span></span>
